3	// The parser exists because the framework may depend only on libc++ + the
4	// shared ABI header -- no third-party JSON library. It must handle the engine
5	// descriptor shape (objects, string/number values, arrays of strings, one
6	// nested object) plus the usual literals and whitespace.
